<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>AI工具与模型HOT</title><link>https://ai-tool-model-hot.pages.dev/</link><description>每天从 19 个信源（16 个 RSS + 3 个 Hugging Face 组织页）收 AI 模型发布与主流智能体更新，按规则打分精选，只显示标题、一句简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:41:08 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>Gemini API 推出 Tool Retrieval：智能体工具按需加载</title><link>https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/gemini-api-tool-retrieval</link><description>Google 在 Gemini API 中推出 Tool Retrieval 预览版，让智能体把庞大工具库留在待命状态、只在需要时加载参数结构，从而省下输入 token 并保持工具选择的准确性。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b00f82b6db94c2e5b3b683ce3a1ae5d0e73a5a6b</guid><source url="https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/gemini-api-tool-retrieval">Google AI Blog</source></item><item><title>Claude Code 2.1.329</title><link>https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-329</link><description>2.1.329 版给钩子配置加了两处安全提醒：弹窗会说明钩子是在哪个文件夹声明的，非交互环境下也会提示受管设置中的钩子。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:20:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">1c4ac2b04a513efc7a824c390f37ca8beb175f04</guid><source url="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-329">Claude Code Changelog</source></item><item><title>Gemini 4 Neon 上线 GitHub Copilot</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-18-gemini-4-neon-in-github-copilot</link><description>谷歌新一代模型 Gemini 4 Neon 正式登陆 GitHub Copilot，主打智能体编程、多步工具调用与知识工作。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 21:49:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f6cf8ded0e75bec96e1b678b6b93caefa289f4d3</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-18-gemini-4-neon-in-github-copilot">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>Claude Code 2.1.328 发布</title><link>https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-328</link><description>Claude Code 2.1.328 为 Opus 4.6 与 Sonnet 4.6 在 Bedrock、Google Cloud、Foundry 及应用网关上启用自动模式，免权限交互会话默认进入该模式。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 01:2